   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Craveman",
   "resumo_en": "Craveman is the twelfth studio album by American rock musician Ted Nugent, released on September 24, 2002.\nThe album continues the trend, started in the mid-1990s, of Nugent returning to the rawer, harder-rocking sound that made him famous in the 1970s. This stands in sharp contrast to the synth-pop of his 1980s work, and the romantic AOR power-ballads of his early 1990s band Damn Yankees. This album also contains some material from an unreleased Damn Yankees album, Bravo.",
