   "resumo_en": "Shutup & Jam! is the fourteenth studio album by American rock musician Ted Nugent. It was released on July 7, 2014, in the United Kingdom and on July 8, 2014, in the United States. It features a guest appearance by Sammy Hagar on the song \"She's Gone\", and is Nugent's first studio album since 2007's Love Grenade.\nThe album was released on CD, red 12-inch vinyl, and as digital download. This is the last album to feature drummer Mick Brown.",
